  },
  {
   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/13816450.html",
   "text": "2025年，广告行业的八位大咖被这些作品打动",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/13816450.html",
   "text": "今年AI应用蓬勃发展，很多人会问，创意还有用吗，传统广告还有效吗？",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://a.jiemian.com/index.php?m=user&a=center&id=100743852",
   "text": "马越",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/13624416.html",
   "text": "",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/13624416.html",
   "text": "亨氏借势全运会的广告出圈，不光是因为创意好",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/13624416.html",
   "text": "这次亨氏番茄酱广告的出圈，不在于创意多有非常规的“颠覆性”或者话题度，而在于大众对于“返璞归真”广告创意的渴望得到了共鸣。",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://a.jiemian.com/index.php?m=user&a=center&id=100743852",
   "text": "马越",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/12977861.html",
   "text": "",
