   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/11993645.html",
   "text": "从营销层面来说，推出短剧的意义不仅在于获得品牌曝光，更为关键的则是，与传统文旅主题结合能在品牌扩张期进一步强化品牌叙事与定位。",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://a.jiemian.com/index.php?m=user&a=center&id=120487578",
   "text": "李烨LY1",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/11927642.html",
   "text": "",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/11927642.html",
   "text": "Blueglass因“男友力”擦边广告被罚40万元",
