   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/11927642.html",
   "text": "在涉及食品饮料的擦边广告中，更容易让人引发食品安全风险的联想，甚至感到被冒犯。",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://a.jiemian.com/index.php?m=user&a=center&id=100743852",
   "text": "马越",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/11888117.html",
   "text": "",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/11888117.html",
   "text": "为什么今天那么多人拿着锅铲冲向麦当劳？",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/11888117.html",
   "text": "人们或许需要的不是一个免费板烧鸡腿堡，他们更在意的是玩梗互动的过程。",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/11837743.html",
   "text": "",
   "region": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "href": "https://www.jiemian.com/article/11837743.html",
   "text": "LINE FRIENDS拉上权志龙等“爱豆”再扩市场",
